00:15:14,841 --> 00:15:18,240
rims in half, put a tire in, and then bolt them back together, and that could be done

182
00:15:18,241 --> 00:15:19,240
in the field.

183
00:15:19,241 --> 00:15:22,440
Over here on the side of the body are some handles for manhandling features that the

184
00:15:22,441 --> 00:15:26,160
government was looking for so GIs could move the vehicle around when it got stuck.

185
00:15:26,161 --> 00:15:29,720
Another interesting device that they came up with the Jeep was this manual hand crank.

186
00:15:29,721 --> 00:15:32,840
In case your starter didn't work, you weren't out of luck because you could just hook this

