00:15:44,861 --> 00:15:48,660
an absolute blackout where no lights are on in the vehicle at all.

191
00:15:48,661 --> 00:15:52,740
This is a spare jerry can or gas can which carries five gallons of gasoline.

192
00:15:52,741 --> 00:15:59,480
The driver sat on top of 15 gallons of gas that you filled up in a gas tank like that.

193
00:15:59,481 --> 00:16:04,080
Inside interestingly are these nifty hand wipers that both the driver and the passenger

194
00:16:04,081 --> 00:16:07,240
had to operate depending on who had their hands straight.

195
00:16:07,241 --> 00:16:09,760
You could just unhook the headlight, flip it up,

196
00:16:09,761 --> 00:16:11,220
and maneuver it so that you could work out

197
00:16:11,221 --> 00:16:15,200
the famous four-cylinder, 134 cubic inch,

198
00:16:15,201 --> 00:16:17,800
60 horsepower, go-devil engine.

199
00:16:17,801 --> 00:16:20,520
Then during the day, if you had a problem with aircraft,

200
00:16:20,521 --> 00:16:23,200
you were under an aircraft attack or something like that,

201
00:16:23,201 --> 00:16:26,800
you would basically put this cover on and tie it around.

202
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:31,580
Put the headlight back down so that no sunlight

203
00:16:31,581 --> 00:16:33,840
could glint off of the glass and tip aircraft

204
00:16:33,841 --> 00:16:35,100
as to where your location was.

205
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:37,540
This is the mechanical horse.

206
00:16:37,660 --> 00:16:40,580
This is what the Army was looking for to replace the horse,

207
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:42,480
and it did a superb job.

208
00:16:42,900 --> 00:16:44,620
Just a fantastic vehicle.

209
00:16:48,820 --> 00:16:51,960
But before the U.S. was able to deliver the new vehicle

210
00:16:51,961 --> 00:16:55,240
to European allies, everything suddenly changed.

211
00:16:57,880 --> 00:17:00,080
December 7, 1941.

212
00:17:00,081 --> 00:17:05,887
Only one month after the first Jeeps rolled off the assembly line, the U.S.

213
00:17:05,888 --> 00:17:08,520
was finally, inextricably, at war.

214
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:19,360
After more than three years of anticipation and dread, American soldiers and their new Jeeps would soon be deployed to war in staggering numbers.

215
00:17:23,700 --> 00:17:27,960
In Desert Storm, inflatable Humvees were used to deceive the enemy.

